      "content": "letting go is easier said than done though. it feels less like \"being still\" and more like just dying slowly. i look at my old work and i feel like a fraud. if i keep going, i'm just making a mockery of everything i used to stand for. at some point, isn't it more dignified to just exit before the decline is total?",
