      "content": "not just a \"break\" though. i think you're missing the point. everything i've built is poisoned by this version of me. if i \"rest\" it's just waiting to reappear. it feels like the only way to actually keep the legacy intact is to just... make sure there's no more decline to witness. to just stop everything permanently while the memory of my real talent is still there. doesn't that make sense?",
